.TH SDL_GetGamepadButtonLabelForType 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetGamepadButtonLabelForType \- Get the label of a button on a gamepad.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_gamepad.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_GamepadButtonLabel SDL_GetGamepadButtonLabelForType(SDL_GamepadType type, SDL_GamepadButton button);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I type
the type of gamepad to check\[char46]
.TP
.I button
a button index (one of the
.BR SDL_GamepadButton
values)\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the
.BR SDL_GamepadButtonLabel
enum corresponding to the button label\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

